\title{Last digit in base 10}
\date{2026-03-04T02:54:20Z}
\tag{discrete}

\import{discrete-macros}

\taxon{Example}
\p{What about the example from last time where two numbers were related when they had the same last digit in base #{10}? This is an [equivalence relation](008Z) too. Reflexivity, symmetry, and transitivity follow straightforwardly from the definition. Later in the semester, we will explore a more general version of this relation.}
